    "gaps": [
      "The registered argv is fixed. selected_row_count is enforced against native prepare_checks, with at most 15 rows; larger selections require renormalization. Native traversal itself has no count cap.",
      "Root loop carries inactive state on the zero-row path to support Lunar scoped exhaustion; no native row call occurs on that path. Snapshot-only functions are callable but unreachable under the fixed registered argv.",
      "Hub preflight, dry-run, subprocess timeout (900 seconds) and write audit remain the native enclosing boundary, not runner nodes. The 3600-second host ceiling is normalization metadata, not a native timeout.",
      "Payload schemas summarize native values; subprocess capabilities remain unqualified. Native reports, checks, dependency snapshots and CLI output retain source behavior; required host receipts do not upgrade optional native logging."
    ]
  },
